      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "FIRST TEST: only after both F64 patterns fail, propose an approved synthetic sandbox benchmark on the larger SKU.\nNo scale-up or tenant inspection was performed; check working set, throughput and other workload occupancy.",
